 of the day after the last rental day
 (exclusive), so `2026-07-01T00:00:00Z` to `2026-07-03T00:00:00Z` is two days. `quote` and `book` throw for
 an unknown item or an invalid period; `book` also throws if the item is already booked for any overlapping
-time. Cancellations (and their refund policy: none under 24 h before start, otherwise full) are not
